cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the CP-GFM public interface or reference the associated scientific results, please cite both the public repository and the 
ChemRxiv preprint: CP-GFM-SGX: Topology-Aware Cyclic Peptide Generation and Design with Receptor-Conditioned Structural Evaluation and Experimental KRAS Affinity Optimization (version 1, DOI: https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15010253/v1)."
title: "CP-GFM Public Interface: a topology-aware framework for target-specific cyclic peptide discovery"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-06
abstract: >-
  Public scientific interface of CP-GFM, a topology-aware generative and
  runtime decision framework for target-specific cyclic peptide discovery.
  This repository describes the architecture, the public data contracts, and a
  synthetic toy execution. It does not contain the production implementation.
keywords:
  - cyclic peptide
  - generative model
  - multi-objective optimization
  - topology-aware design
  - scientific interface
authors:
  - name: "CP-GFM Contributors"
    # Individual authorship to be finalized during legal review.
